# Public keys that sign MonitorFlow release files (ADR-0053): Ed25519, in
# PEM (SubjectPublicKeyInfo), as `openssl pkey -pubout` writes them. The
# agent, relay and server are built with every key in this file, and an
# agent installs no binary whose SHA256SUMS.sig verifies against none of
# them. deploy/release-files.sh copies them into install.sh.
#
# Text outside the PEM blocks is ignored. To rotate, add the new key here
# and release with the old one; once that release is deployed, sign with
# the new key and remove the old one (docs/releasing.md).
#
# No key yet: until one is added, agents refuse every self-update and the
# release workflow refuses to publish.
